<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's Tuntex 1st-half turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's Tuntex 1st-half turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>				   (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     5,171 vs	  7,579</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  loss 712 vs profit 1,970</p>
<p>NOTE - Tuntex Distinct Corp is one of Taiwan's leading chemical fibre and construction firms. A company spokesman attributed the loss to polyester fibre price falls this year and the poorly performing construction sector.</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
